---
import BaseHead from '../components/BaseHead.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead title="Privacy Policy" description="Tease Privacy Policy" />
  </head>

  <body>
    <Header />

    <main class="fade-up">
      <div style="max-width: 720px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 3rem 1.5rem;">
        <h1>Tease Privacy Policy</h1>

        <p>
          Tease ("Tease," "we," "us") is a luxury tea club and tasting journal app. This policy explains what
          information the Tease app collects, how we use it, and the choices you have. Our website is try-tease.com.
        </p>

        <h2>Who can use Tease</h2>
        <p>
          Tease is for people 18 or older. We ask for your date of birth when you sign up to confirm your age. We do
          not knowingly collect information from anyone under 18. If you believe a person under 18 has created an
          account, contact us and we will delete it.
        </p>

        <h2>Information we collect</h2>
        <p>
          When you create an account, we collect your first and last name, email address, password, date of birth,
          city, and state.
        </p>
        <p>
          When you use the journal, we store the tasting notes you write: tea name, type, style, location, year,
          season, appearance, aroma, flavor, mouthfeel, finish, other notes, and your rating.
        </p>
        <p>We do not collect your precise location, contacts, photos, or payment information in the app today.</p>

        <h2>How we use your information</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>To create and secure your account and sign you in.</li>
          <li>To confirm you are 18 or older.</li>
          <li>To store and show you your tasting notes.</li>
          <li>To suggest members and events near you in the future, based on your city and state.</li>
          <li>To contact you about your account or about Tease.</li>
          <li>To keep the app working and fix problems.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We do not sell your personal information, and we do not use it for third-party advertising.</p>

        <h2>Who can see your information</h2>
        <p>Your tasting notes are private to your account. Other members cannot see them.</p>
        <p>
          Your information is stored with our service provider Supabase, which hosts our database and sign-in system.
          Your password is stored in scrambled (hashed) form, and we cannot read it. We may share information with
          other service providers only as needed to run the app, or if the law requires it.
        </p>
        <p>
          If we add features that let members see each other, such as friends or events, we will update this policy
          first and tell you what would be visible.
        </p>

        <h2>How long we keep it</h2>
        <p>
          We keep your information while your account is open. If you delete your account, we delete your profile and
          tasting notes, except where we must keep something for legal reasons. Backups may take a short time to
          clear.
        </p>

        <h2>Your choices and rights</h2>
        <p>
          You can ask us to show you the information we hold about you, correct it, or delete it. Contact us at the
          email below. If you live in California or another state with privacy laws, you may have additional rights,
          including the right to know what we collect and to request deletion. We will not treat you differently for
          asking.
        </p>

        <h2>Security</h2>
        <p>
          We use reasonable measures to protect your information, including encrypted connections and access rules
          that limit each account to its own data. No system is perfectly secure, so we cannot guarantee absolute
          security.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to this policy</h2>
        <p>
          We may update this policy. When we do, we will change the effective date at the top and, for significant
          changes, notify you in the app or by email.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact us</h2>
        <p>
          Tease<br />
          Email: <a href="mailto:trytease@gmail.com">trytease@gmail.com</a><br />
          Website: try-tease.com
        </p>

        <p>
          James and Nadine<br />
          Founders, Tease
        </p>
      </div>
    </main>

    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
